ind": "text", "text": "0.87", "bbox": {"x": 1204.5, "y": 847.2, "width": 19.0, "height": 41.10000000000002}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "-0.08", "bbox": {"x": 1204.5, "y": 752.4, "width": 19.0, "height": 53.700000000000045}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "［-0.16， -0.003］", "bbox": {"x": 1201.4, "y": 581.7, "width": 22.09999999999991, "height": 145.39999999999998}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "0.04", "bbox": {"x": 1204.5, "y": 496.3, "width": 19.0, "height": 37.900000000000034}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "0.002", "bbox": {"x": 1204.5, "y": 392.0, "width": 19.0, "height": 50.60000000000002}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "[-0.07, 0.07]", "bbox": {"x": 1204.5, "y": 256.1, "width": 22.09999999999991, "height": 113.80000000000001}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "0.91", "bbox": {"x": 1176.1, "y": 170.7, "width": 22.09999999999991, "height": 41.099999999999994}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "0.96", "bbox": {"x": 1204.5, "y": 167.6, "width": 19.0, "height": 41.099999999999994}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "'Data are presented as mean ‡ SD, median [IQR] or absolute number (%). Associations of biomarkers with variables were tested via univariable (model 1) and multivariable (model 2) regression analyses of which", "bbox": {"x": 1239.3, "y": 189.7, "width": 28.40000000000009, "height": 1773.6}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "standardized ß coefficients (St B) are given, referring to the number of SD change in the dependent variable (biomarker) per SD increment in the independent variable. Model 1: crude model; model 2: model 1 + adjustment for age, sex, total caloric intake, BMI, and eGFR. KTR, kidney transplant recipient; NA, not applicable; Ref, reference; st ß, standardized ß coefficient; uex IMH, urinary 1-methylhistidine excretion; uex3MH, urinary", "bbox": {"x": 1267.8, "y": 154.9, "width": 50.5, "height": 1852.5}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "3-methylhistidine excretion.", "bbox": {"x": 1321.5, "y": 1770.3, "width": 22.09999999999991, "height": 237.0999999999999}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "'Maroni equation (g/d) = 0.18 * urinary urea excretion in mmol/24 h + 0.19 * body weight in kg + urinary protein excretion in g/d.", "bbox": {"x": 1343.6, "y": 859.8, "width": 28.299999999999955, "height": 1103.4}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Data do not sum up to 100% because of missing data [n = 58 (8.6%)].", "bbox": {"x": 1372.1, "y": 1368.9, "width": 25.299999999999955, "height": 594.3}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Meat intake and survival in kidney transplants", "bbox": {"x": 578.3, "y": 94.7, "width": 468.39999999999986, "height": 33.2}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "1511", "bbox": {"x": 1451.1, "y": 98.0, "width": 60.09999999999991, "height": 25.299999999999997}}], "ms": 528.06}